      "title": "Prompt Chain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Storyboard -> OpenAI Refiner -> Conditioning.prompt\n***Set env first***\nOpenAI Refiner key: env Name by your written.\nOfficial H3 Context IR: env IR_KEY.\nLet your env varint = your API key\nConditioning.width/height set output resolution. FL Constraint and PackageData cannot be mixed."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#6a4fa3"
    },
