      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "You can load your assets here.\nAfter load a media ,you must set the function of the media to use official IR API,note is optional,but I recommend you to fill it with the content of pictures/videos to help LLMs(especially for non-multimodal third-party LLMs) to polish or arrange contents and shots.\n***When you use refiner ,your assets may be upload to sever.***"
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        1162.8561741162507,
