      ],
      "size": [
        225,
        474.171875
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "You can add overall Subjects in the subject column and then named it like this :\nAlice\na woman in the appearance of <Picture 1>.\nyou can use subjects' name in next prompt ,the backend will automatically transform into standard <Subject N>, the name in dialogues：\nsuch as <d>[]words</d> won't be wrongly transformed.\nMark the first speak person with (S1) like:\n[Shot 1] <Subject 2> (S1) says: <d>[English] Hi Bob.</d>\n[Shot 2] <Subject 1> (S2) says: <d>[English] Hello Alice.</d>\n[Shot 3] Alice (S1) says: <d>[English] Let's go.</d>(You can use name in prompt.)\nwith LLMs it will be written automatically(No matter official or third-party)."
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
